sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: What POST /sync does
    accDescr: The module reads categories and products from the store's WooCommerce API with the tenant's credentials. It registers four kinds of ontology types in parse-tree, then writes category nodes, attribute class nodes, attribute value nodes and product nodes. Finally it trains product text into document search as vectors and as keyword documents, and returns counts.
    autonumber
    participant API as POST /api/tenants/{id}/sync
    participant WC as WooCommerce REST API
    participant PT as package-parse-tree
    participant DS as package-document-search
    API->>WC: fetch categories and products (tenant credentials)
    API->>PT: register types: category, attribute, each object attribute, product
    API->>PT: upsert category nodes
    API->>PT: upsert attribute class nodes and attribute value nodes
    API->>PT: upsert product nodes (units applied)
    API->>DS: train_vectors([ids, "name description"])
    API->>DS: train_keywords(id, title, description)
    API-->>API: categories_indexed, attributes_indexed, products_indexed
